WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 3.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:04.712
Waitlist Impact by Province.

00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:08.537
The crisis is national, but the suffering is local.

00:00:08.537 --> 00:00:11.687
There is no province where the system works.

00:00:11.687 --> 00:00:17.562
Canadians wait, suffer, and die while their own health authorities document every failure.
